            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="action-card card-blue">
            <div class="action-icon">📸</div>
            <div class="action-body">
              <h3>Life at DGL</h3>
              <p>Take a tour through what's happening around the vibrant school environment.</p>
              <a href="#life" class="action-link">Explore Gallery →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PUPILS ARE THE HEART -->
    <section class="heart-section" id="pupils">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="heart-card-wrapper">
          <div class="heart-grid">
            <div class="heart-content">
              <span class="section-tag">Student Life</span>
              <h2 class="section-title">The pupils are the heart of DGL.</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">From the classroom to collaborative activities, we celebrate the children, their individual progress, and the daily moments that make school special.</p>
              <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                <a href="/pupils" class="btn btn-secondary">View More →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="heart-media">
              <div class="media-box">
                <div class="media-photo">📚</div>
                <div class="media-label">Classroom Learning</div>
              </div>
              <div class="media-box">
                <div class="media-photo">🎨</div>
                <div class="media-label">Group Activity</div>
              </div>
              <div class="media-box">
                <div class="media-photo">✏️</div>
                <div class="media-label">Creative Arts</div>
              </div>
              <div class="media-box">
                <div class="media-photo">⚽</div>
                <div class="media-label">Sports & Play</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LIFE AT DGL -->
    <section class="life-section" id="life">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="life-header">
          <div>
            <span class="section-tag tag-blue">School Experience</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Something is always happening at DGL.</h2>
            <p class="section-desc">A peek into our active school calendar, hands-on learning, and vibrant school events.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/life" class="btn btn-outline">See Life at DGL →</a>
        </div>

        {recentPosts.length > 0 ? (
          <div class="life-grid">
            {recentPosts.map((post, i) => (
              <div
                class={`journal-card ${TONE_CYCLE[i % TONE_CYCLE.length]}`}
                id={post.slug}
                onclick={`openPost('${post.slug}')`}
              >
                <div class="card-media">
                  {post.imageUrl ? (
                    <img src={post.imageUrl} alt={post.title} />
                  ) : (
                    <span class="placeholder-icon">{post.isVideo ? '🎬' : '📸'}</span>
                  )}
                  {post.isVideo && <div class="video-indicator">▶</div>}
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                  <div class="card-meta-bar">
                    <span class="card-category">{post.categoryLabel}</span>
                    <span class="card-date">{post.dateLabel}</span>
                  </div>
                  <h3 class="card-title">{post.title}</h3>
                  <div class="card-footer">
                    <span class="card-action-text">{post.isVideo ? 'Watch video →' : 'View story →'}</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        ) : (
          <p class="section-desc">New moments from DGL are on their way — check back soon! 🌱</p>
        )}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LOCATION & CONTACT -->
    <section class="location-section" id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="location-card-wrapper">
            <div>
              <span class="section-tag tag-purple">Location</span>
              <h2 class="section-title">Visit Us in Idimu</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">We welcome prospective parents to visit our school premises and experience our supportive community firsthand.</p>

              <div class="address-box">
                <strong>Address:</strong><br />
                27, Asunbe Street, Off Tejumola Estate, Arobaba Street, Idimu, Lagos, Nigeria
              </div>

              <div class="contact-methods">
                <a href={`tel:${phoneSupport}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Us Directly</a>
                <a href={whatsAppChannelLink} class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color: var(--color-green); color: var(--color-green); background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);">WhatsApp Us</a>
              </div>
            </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div class="modal-overlay" id="postModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <button class="modal-nav-btn modal-prev-btn" id="modalPrevBtn" onclick="navigatePost(-1)" aria-label="Previous moment" hidden>&#8249;</button>
    <button class="modal-nav-btn modal-next-btn" id="modalNextBtn" onclick="navigatePost(1)" aria-label="Next moment" hidden>&#8250;</button>
    <div class="modal-container" id="modalContainer">
      <button class="modal-close-btn" onclick="closeModal()" aria-label="Close modal">&times;</button>
      <div class="modal-media-box" id="modalMedia">
        [ Photo / Lightweight YouTube Player Container ]
      </div>
      <button class="modal-rotate-btn" id="modalRotateBtn" onclick="rotateMedia()" aria-label="Rotate photo" hidden>&#8635;</button>
      <div class="modal-caption">
        <h2 class="modal-caption-title" id="modalTitle">Moment Title</h2>
        <div class="modal-caption-meta" id="modalMeta">Category · Session</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <a href="index.html" class="brand" style="color: var(--color-white);">
            <img src="/asset/DGLS-Badge-two-colour.svg" class="brand-badge" alt="DAN-GRACIOUS LAND Badge">
            <div class="brand-text">
              <span class="brand-title" style="color: var(--color-white);">DAN-GRACIOUS LAND</span>
              <span class="brand-subtitle" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">Nursery & Primary School</span>
            </div>
          </a>
          <p>More than a school. A place to grow. Serving nursery and primary pupils in Idimu, Lagos State.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-column">
          <h4>Explore</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="/pupils">Pupils</a></li>
            <li><a href="/life">Life at DGL</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-column">
